		{
			description: [
				"&f&lThe Toolkit.&r"
				""
				"Small mods that don't add a progression tree - just make everything else better. All active from the moment you join, nothing to craft."
			]
			icon: "minecraft:crafting_table"
			id: "5CF5F404538F3494"
			rewards: [{
				id: "790846256F40C06F"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 10
			}]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.5d
			subtitle: "&7Small mods, big QoL"
			tasks: [{
				id: "709F737D185DD541"
				title: "Begin"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "&fThe Toolkit"
			x: 0.0d
			y: -3.5d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"&eJade&r shows a tooltip for whatever you're looking at - block contents, machine progress, entity health. Look at things. It just works."
				""
				"&e&lIt is the fastest debugging tool in the pack.&r Look at a stalled machine and Jade tells you whether it is out of power, out of input, or full of output - which is three different fixes and otherwise indistinguishable."
				""
				"&7Useful things it reads without opening anything:&r"
				"&7- Machine progress bars and energy buffers"
				"&7- Tank contents and amounts"
				"&7- What a drawer or barrel holds and how full it is"
				"&7- Growth stage of crops - so you know if a farm is actually working"
				"&7- Mob health and armour, including Apotheosis affixes"
				""
				"&e&lPress the config key to filter what it shows.&r The default overlay gets noisy in a machine room; trimming it to energy and progress makes it far more useful."
				""
				"&8JadeAddons extends it to more of this pack's mods. Both are already installed - nothing to craft, just look at things."
			]
			icon: "minecraft:spyglass"
			id: "6A0BBEDFA2503F3B"
			rewards: [{
				id: "5247D7E02E34D9ED"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 5
			}]
			subtitle: "&7Look at things"
			tasks: [{
				id: "06063321BE308BF1"
				title: "Read"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "&bJade"
			x: -4.5d
			y: -1.5d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"&eInventory Profiles Next&r one-click sorts your inventory, auto-refills broken tools and depleted stacks from elsewhere in your bags, and auto-dumps into matching containers."
				""
				"&e&lThe three features that actually matter here:&r"
				"&7- &fSort buttons&7 - appear at the top of every container. One click and a chest of sieve output becomes readable."
				"&7- &fAuto-refill&7 - when a stack in your hotbar runs out, it silently pulls more from your inventory. You will not notice it until you play without it."
				"&7- &fMove-all&7 - shift-click variants that shove everything matching into the open container. This is how you unload after a sieving session."
				""
				"&7Hold a modifier while clicking sort to change the sort order - by name, by count, by mod.&r"
				""
				"&8The auto-crafting checkbox that used to appear on crafting tables was this mod, and it is disabled in this pack on purpose. Sorting, move-all and auto-refill are untouched."
			]
			icon: "minecraft:chest"
			id: "35D65CEDF7858F20"
			rewards: [{
				id: "140147B58DADC194"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 5
			}]
			subtitle: "&7One-click sort"
			tasks: [{
