				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "&6Inventory Profiles Next"
			x: -1.5d
			y: -1.5d
		}
		{
			description: ["&eQuests Additions&r gives this very book new task types - Place, Break, Repeatable, Create-Structure - for anything added to it down the line."]
