		{
			dependencies: ["5CF5F404538F3494"]
			description: [
				"&eWaystones&r are teleport markers. Right-click one to attune, then travel between them from anywhere."
				""
				"&7On a multi-island base they remove a great deal of walking, and a Warp Stone in your inventory lets you jump to the nearest one on a cooldown.&r"
				""
				"&8Cheaper and available far earlier than Mekanism teleporters or Draconic dislocators."
			]
