		{
			dependencies: ["5CF5F404538F3494"]
			description: [
				"JEI is installed and most people use a tenth of it."
				""
				"&7- &fR&7 on an item shows how to make it; &fU&7 shows what it is used for."
				"&7- &f@mod&7 filters by mod, &f#tag&7 by tag."
				"&7- Click a recipe's arrow to see alternatives from other mods."
				"&7- &fBookmark&7 an item with &fA&7 so you can find it again."
				""
				"&e&lIn a 167-mod pack, several mods usually make the same thing.&r JEI is how you find the cheapest route rather than the first one."
			]
