		{
			dependencies: ["5CF5F404538F3494"]
			description: [
				"Several mods here exist purely to keep the pack playable: &eEmbeddium&r, &eFerriteCore&r, &eModernFix&r, &eEntity Culling&r and &eClumps&r."
				""
				"&7Clumps in particular merges XP orbs, which is the difference between a mob farm being fine and a mob farm dropping your framerate to nothing.&r"
				""
				"&8Nothing to craft. Worth knowing they are there before you go looking for a lag cause."
			]
